{"id":"e942ab724bac5e6c","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-zfc-game4-correlated-strategy.md","title":"ZFC Game4 Correlated Strategy","display":"df-zfc-game4-correlated-strategy — ZFC Game4 Correlated Strategy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-game4-correlated-strategy","aliases":["58-df-zfc-game4-correlated-strategy"],"display":"df-zfc-game4-correlated-strategy — ZFC Game4 Correlated Strategy","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-finite]]","[[58-df-product]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-game4-correlated-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-game4-correlated-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-game4-correlated-strategy — ZFC Game4 Correlated Strategy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3579e07be41aa5cd\" href=\"?note=3579e07be41aa5cd\" title=\"58-df-product\">58-df-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" href=\"?note=29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure\">58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (ambient formal setting)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,\\vec S,\\mu\\in V\">\\(N,\\vec S,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\)</span> (probability-measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" href=\"?note=29e8d6cd15d08f4f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure\">58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4CorrelatedStrategy}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGame4CorrelatedStrategy}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}correlated\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4CorrelatedStrategy}_S(N,\\vec S,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow N\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\Bigl(\\prod_{i\\in N}\\vec S(i),\\mathcal P\\bigl(\\prod_{i\\in N}\\vec S(i)\\bigr),\\mu\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}correlated\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4CorrelatedStrategy}_S(N,\\vec S,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow N\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\Bigl(\\prod_{i\\in N}\\vec S(i),\\mathcal P\\bigl(\\prod_{i\\in N}\\vec S(i)\\bigr),\\mu\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A correlated strategy is a probability measure on the finite product of nonempty pure-strategy sets.</li>\n<li>The former <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbMeasure}\\)</span> symbol and arrow declaration are replaced by the actual probability-measure and function predicates.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"3579e07be41aa5cd","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure","status":"resolved","id":"29e8d6cd15d08f4f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[58-df-finite]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure","status":"resolved","id":"29e8d6cd15d08f4f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S$ (probability-measure predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-measure6-probability-measure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"N,\\vec S,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGame4CorrelatedStrategy}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}game4\\text{-}correlated\\text{-}strategy} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcGame4CorrelatedStrategy}_S(N,\\vec S,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow N\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathrm{Finite}(N)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec S,N,\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec S))\\land\\forall i\\in N\\;(\\vec S(i)\\neq\\emptyset)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure6ProbabilityMeasure}_S\\Bigl(\\prod_{i\\in N}\\vec S(i),\\mathcal P\\bigl(\\prod_{i\\in N}\\vec S(i)\\bigr),\\mu\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbMeasure}","display":false}],"bytes":1562,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-game4-correlated-strategy.md|58-df-zfc-game4-correlated-strategy]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","d9a25b0ac94a3